# Ignore everything by default, then explicitly allow only what should be pushed.
*
!.gitignore
!requirements.txt
!apriltag_centering/
!apriltag_centering/**
apriltag_centering/track_moving_apriltag.py
apriltag_centering/track_stationary_apriltag.py
!hand_control/
!hand_control/**
!audio/
!audio/**
!mqttlib.py
!table_tennis/
!table_tennis/**
table_tennis/results.log

# Re-ignore compiled bytecode caches everywhere, even inside the folders
# whitelisted above -- machine/version-specific, never worth tracking.
**/__pycache__/